{"blocks":[["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Max/","source-block-285","There are two sub-plans as of 2025/07",["Claude Max \\ Anthropic"]],["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Max/","source-block-330","Anthropic/Product/Claude/Max/5x is $100/month",["Claude Max \\ Anthropic","There are two sub-plans as of 2025/07"]],["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Max/","source-block-384","Anthropic/Product/Claude/Max/20x is $200/month",["Claude Max \\ Anthropic","There are two sub-plans as of 2025/07"]],["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Platform/AWS/","source-block-147","Claude Platform on AWS",[]],["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Platform/AWS/","source-block-174","Announcements and sources",["Claude Platform on AWS"]],["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Platform/AWS/","source-block-206","Anthropic/Blog/26/05/Introducing the Claude Platform on AWS — product/feature story and Bedrock vs native-platform split.",["Claude Platform on AWS","Announcements and sources"]],["Anthropic/Product/Claude/Platform/AWS/","source-block-338","AWS/Blog/26/05/Claude Platform on AWS — AWS IAM, CloudTrail, billing, and FAQ framing.",["Claude Platform on AWS","Announcements and sources"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-42","Introducing Claude Code - YouTube - Claude/Code",[]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-143","runtime: 3min 54sec",[]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","block-67bda95a-e5c3-4ba8-b5ec-a918606d2244","my notes",["runtime: 3min 54sec"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-316","Vid",["runtime: 3min 54sec"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-384","Intro (skip)",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-428","00:00 Should we be doing like big smile or? - No, what you're doing- - Big smile's creepy. That's sort of what I'm getting at. I'm Boris, I'm an engineer. I'm Cat, I'm a product manager. We love seeing what people build with Claude, especially with coding,",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","Intro (skip)"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-709","00:12 and we want to make Claude better at coding for everyone. We built some tools, one of which we're sharing today. We're launching Claude Code as a research preview. Claude Code is an agentic coding tool",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","Intro (skip)"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-942","opening Terminal and invoking claude CLI/Tool",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1004","00:27 that lets you work with Claude directly in your terminal. We're gonna show you an example of it in action. So we have a project here. It's a nextjs app. 00:35 Let's open it up in an instance of Claude Code.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","opening Terminal and invoking claude CLI/Tool"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1265","right click on project folder > Services > New iTerm2 Window Here",["Vid","opening Terminal and invoking claude CLI/Tool","00:27 that lets you work with Claude directly in your terminal. We're gonna show you an example of it in action. So we have a project here. It's a nextjs app. 0"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1344","In the CLI: claude is invoked",["Vid","opening Terminal and invoking claude CLI/Tool","00:27 that lets you work with Claude directly in your terminal. We're gonna show you an example of it in action. So we have a project here. It's a nextjs app. 0"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1385","overview",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1403","00:41 Now that we've done this, Claude Code has access to all of the files in this repository.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","overview"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","block-67bdac23-a87b-4eb9-8558-6222ee77337b","One of the first times I've seen a compelling Chat UI in CLI - is this Curses?",["Vid","overview","00:41 Now that we've done this, Claude Code has access to all of the files in this repository."]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1668","We don't know much about this codebase. It looks like an app for chatting with a customer support agent.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","overview"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1779","explain codebase",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1805","Let's get Claude to help explain this codebase to us.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","explain codebase"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1865","they prompt it: \"explain to me this project structure\"",["Vid","explain codebase","Let's get Claude to help explain this codebase to us."]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1929","Claude starts by reading the higher level files",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","explain codebase"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-1983","00:59 and then it dives in deeper. Now it's going through all the components in the project. Cool, here's its final analysis.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","explain codebase"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-2134","it gathers lots of context from the repository its analysis produces a report of key dependencies, deployment, project structure, etc",["Vid","explain codebase","00:59 and then it dives in deeper. Now it's going through all the components in the project. Cool, here's its final analysis."]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","block-67bdad0a-ee74-4ac1-996f-e5ba4e4feebf","will this remove the need for tools like Repomix ?",["Vid","explain codebase","00:59 and then it dives in deeper. Now it's going through all the components in the project. Cool, here's its final analysis."]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-2390","it takes a minute or more (they speed it up)",["Vid","explain codebase","00:59 and then it dives in deeper. Now it's going through all the components in the project. Cool, here's its final analysis."]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-2444","01:16 use case - editing code to update the website served by the repo",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-2543","use case - editing code: So say I was asked to replace this left sidebar with a chat history, and I'm also gonna add a new chat button.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","01:16 use case - editing code to update the website served by the repo"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-2689","01:22 I'm gonna ask Claude to help me out here. We haven't specified any files or paths and Claude's already finding the right files to update by itself. Claude can also show its thinking and we can see how it's decided to tackle this problem.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid","01:16 use case - editing code to update the website served by the repo"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-2958","01:44 Claude's asking me if I wanna accept these changes. I'll say, yeah. Now Claude's updating the nav bar, adding a button and icons as well. Next, it's updating the logic to ensure the saving state works correctly. After a bit, Claude completes the task.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-3241","02:05 Here's a summary of what it's done. Let's take a look at the app. So we're seeing the new chat button and new chat history section on the left. Let's check if I can start a new chat while keeping the previous one saved.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-3492","02:20 I'll try out the new chat button too. Great, it's all working. Now let's ask Claude to add some tests to make sure that the features we just added work. Claude's asking for permission to run commands. We'll say yes.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-3739","02:41 Claude is making some changes to run these tests. After getting the results, it continues with its plan until all tests pass. After a few minutes, it looks like we're good to go. Now I'm going to ask Claude to compile the app",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-3996","03:08 and see if we get any build errors. Let's see what it finds. Claude identified the build errors and is now fixing them. Then it tries to build again. It'll keep going until it works. Now let's finish everything up by asking Claude to commit its changes",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/02/Introducing%20Claude%20Code/","source-block-4280","03:30 and push them to GitHub. Claude creates a summary and a description of our changes. And it'll push the changes to GitHub. That's it, that's an example of what Claude Code can do. We can't wait for people to start building with it.",["runtime: 3min 54sec","Vid"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-76","Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code",[]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","block-688e2332-502a-4106-aa81-ddeb8aed57cc","My Notes",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-246","Nice reminder of Agentic definition from Anthropic/Blog/24/12/Building Effective Agents",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","My Notes"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-392","It's interesting to hear how skeptical he sounds of MCP use in Claude Code at this time; it sounds \"advanced\" and he advises that people prefer well-documented CLI/Tools over MCP Servers",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","My Notes"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-647","I don't think I've managed to use the AI/Image/Processing features of Claude/Code yet",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","My Notes"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-791","Video",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-865","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-935","Welcome and Overview",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-967","\"Welcome everyone to Claude Code best practices\"",["Video","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Welcome and Overview"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1023","Talk structure:",["Video","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Welcome and Overview"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1046","High-level overview of what Claude Code is",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Welcome and Overview","Talk structure:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1097","Understanding how it works under the hood",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Welcome and Overview","Talk structure:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1147","Good use cases and best practices",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Welcome and Overview","Talk structure:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1189","Personal Introduction",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1222","Cal's background:",["Video","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1247","Joined Anthropic about a year and a half ago",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Cal's background:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1300","Part of the Applied AI team",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Cal's background:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1336","Mission: help customers build great products on top of Claude",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Cal's background:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1406","Spends time prompting Claude for optimal outputs",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Cal's background:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1463","Coding Background",["Video","00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1493","Self-described coder who starts many projects but rarely finishes",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Coding Background"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1567","Has a \"graveyard of code\" from unfinished projects",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Coding Background"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1626","Always spinning up new ideas",["00:05 Introduction and Personal Background","Personal Introduction","Coding Background"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1663","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1722","Initial Encounter",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1751","Heard about new tool in Slack",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Initial Encounter"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1788","Downloaded on a Friday night",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Initial Encounter"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1824","Applied to a new notetaking app project",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Initial Encounter"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1871","Transformative Experience",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-1908","\"That whole weekend just kind of totally changed the way that I code and think about software engineering\"",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Transformative Experience"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2022","Carried laptop around all weekend",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Transformative Experience"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2063","\"Super addicted to just watching Claude Code work\"",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Transformative Experience"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2121","Watched powerful application come together in real-time",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Transformative Experience"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2184","Got much further than would have on own",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Transformative Experience"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2231","Internal Recognition",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2263","Worried about token usage",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2296","Claude Code team had internal leaderboard tracking usage",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2360","Shot to the top over the weekend",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2400","Met Boris and Cat from early Claude Code team",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2453","Became core contributor focusing on:",["Video","01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2497","System prompts",["01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition","Became core contributor focusing on:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2520","Tool descriptions and results",["01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition","Became core contributor focusing on:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2558","Evaluation methodology",["01:04 Discovery of Claude Code","Internal Recognition","Became core contributor focusing on:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2589","02:34 What is Claude Code?",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2645","Mental Model",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2669","\"Claude Code is like that co-worker that does everything on the terminal\"",["Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?","Mental Model"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2750","Never touches GUI, terminal whiz",["Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?","Mental Model"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2790","Like having a mentor (Tony) next to you all the time",["Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?","Mental Model"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-2850","Technical Architecture",["Claude Code best practices - YouTube - Claude/Code","Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","block-688e1ee0-8a38-4879-a2f1-6aad419c8020","Pure agent approach: instructions + powerful tools + model runs in loop",["Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?","Technical Architecture"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-3016","Tools include:",["Video","02:34 What is Claude Code?","Technical Architecture"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-block-3038","File creation and editing",["02:34 What is Claude Code?","Technical Architecture","Tools include:"]],["Anthropic/YouTube/25/07/Claude%20Code%20Best%20Practices/","source-bl